<Base title='About Campground Weekend'><div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The publication</p><h1>About Campground Weekend</h1></div><article class="prose section"><p>Campground Weekend is an independent publication from North Shore Family Adventures. It helps readers compare campgrounds, find their kind of stay and plan manageable camping weekends.</p><p>Wisconsin is our launch coverage area. The brand and site structure can support other destinations as original reporting and research expand. We do not claim national directory coverage.</p><h2>What these field notes are</h2><p>The initial collection is based on official operator information and editorial desk research. It is not a record of personal stays, bathroom inspections, tested gear or verified real-time availability. Each profile provides its sources and a facts-reviewed date.</p><p>North Shore Family Adventures’ existing website remains a separate publication. This project does not migrate or replace it.</p></article></div></Base>
